//   H1  the box is hidden in Lenses mode, in Marks mode, and in Categories mode with no categories
//   H2  Categories mode: the switch (role=group, aria-label), "List" pressed by default, both buttons
//   H3  List: one row per category in the sky's own order (rec.S.items), each with a mark, its name, its
//       book count ("1 book" / "N books"), a chevron and the orb's own aria-label
//   H4  a row calls the same door a category orb calls (lxOrbOpen with the orb's own src object);
//       "Theory & Philosophy" -> #category/Theory%20%26%20Philosophy
//   H5  "By the orbs": stores 'orbs', adds lx-orbnames to the sky host, removes the list, re-lays the sky
//       once (sig reset, one build); "List": stores 'list', removes the class, the list returns
//   H6  pressing the already-pressed choice writes nothing and builds nothing
//   H7  the stored choice is read on the next render; an unknown stored value is treated as 'list'
//   H8  leaving Categories mode removes lx-orbnames (to Lenses, to Marks)
//   H9  a category name carrying HTML is shown as text, never markup
//   H10 the You page mount (renderProfilePage's block): one box under the sky after any number of
//       re-renders, the old host keeps none, each switch button has one listener; the visitor preview
//       mounts no box
//   H11 storage: no key other than praxis_you_catnames is ever written by the views code
//   H12 R6: ACCOUNT_GLOBAL_KEYS holds praxis_you_catnames exactly once; the account-delete local wipe
//       removes it (and another reader's uid key stays); a sign-out alone leaves it
// EXTENSIONLESS on purpose (see tools/parse-check). ASCII-only: cscript reads it as ANSI, so the page's
// chevron arrives as several characters; texts are compared with every non-ASCII run folded to "|".
// The extracted integrations.js text has `.catch(` rewritten to `['catch'](` before it is compiled -- the
// same neutralization tools/parse-check applies (JScript reserves the word); nothing else is changed.
//
